{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PDFSwift 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的 PDF 工具箱，適合需要整理文件、製作履歷及藉助 AI 處理文字的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，大部分 PDF 工具可直接在裝置上執行。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-122.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>文件處理與智能輔助</h2>\n<p>PDFSwift 把常用 PDF 工序集中於 iPhone 與 iPad，可合併、拆分、旋轉及壓縮文件，也能轉換圖片、擷取文字、加鎖解鎖與簽名。它另備專業及地區 CV 範本，可匯出成整潔 PDF；AI 工具支援總結重點、改寫校對、翻譯、文件提問、撰寫求職信或電郵，以及圖片文字辨識。大部分 PDF 工具在裝置上直接執行，免費版含廣告，部分 AI 工具需先觀看短片。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-22.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-23.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-24.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-25.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-26.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2556\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1179x2556bb-27.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：PDFSwift</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pdfswift/id6826854639?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.579996+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":351,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:58:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:17:29.468443+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:43.272179+00:00","content_hash":"53cd95370fbf880bc6e0481bc998cdb7239de4c5172a15c88d72031b0b1eb4a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}